## To release a new version, edit the version in the two lines below and nothing else.
## |cRRGGBB...|r in Title and Author colours them in the in-game add-on list; the version
## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## The settings panel takes its version from ## Title; the name itself is fixed in Main.lua.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB’s QuestTrackerFontChanger|r 1.3.0
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Adjusts the fonts of the HUD trackers in the top right -- the quest tracker (quest name, step description, objectives), the Golden Pursuits panel (also used for Tamriel Tomes) and the house information panel shown on a home tour (house name, owner, visitor count, tags). Size, typeface and outline, configured separately for each; the spacing between the lines follows the text size automatically, the tracker column can be moved and the quest tracker scaled.
## Version: 1.3.0
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## DependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsQuestTrackerFontChanger_Data

lang/strings.lua
lang/$(language).lua

Main.lua
Settings.lua

